    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> instance from the given <code>Document</code>. Allows to explicitly exclude fields from making\nit into the created <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> object. Note, that this will set attributes directly and <em>not</em> use\n$set. This means fields not given in the <code>Document</code> will be nulled when executing the update. To\ncreate an only-updating <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> instance of a <code>Document</code>, call <a href=\"#set(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>set(String, Object)</code></a> for each\nvalue in it.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>Document</code> 创建一个 <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 实例。该方法允许显式地将某些字段排除在生成的 <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 对象之外。请注意，此操作会直接设置属性，而<em>不会</em>使用 $set。这意味着如果某个字段未在 <code>Document</code> 中给出，在执行更新时该字段将被置为 null。若要创建一个仅用于更新的 <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 实例（基于 <code>Document</code>），请对其中每个值调用 <a href=\"#set(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>set(String, Object)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> instance from the given <code>Document</code>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 <code>Document</code> 创建一个 <a href=\"Update.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query 中的类\"><code>Update</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Prevents a write operation that affects <strong>multiple</strong> documents from yielding to other reads or writes\nonce the first document is written. Use with\n<a href=\"../MongoOperations.html#updateMulti(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.Query,org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.UpdateDefinition,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MongoOperations.updateMulti(Query, UpdateDefinition, Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "防止在写入第一个文档后，影响<strong>多个</strong>文档的写操作让位于其他读或写操作。请配合使用\n<a href=\"../MongoOperations.html#updateMulti(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.Query,org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.UpdateDefinition,java.lang.Class)\"><code>MongoOperations.updateMulti(Query, UpdateDefinition, Class)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
